title: "Shape from theory, level from data"
abstract: >-
  Estimator and code release of Antoniu Gugu (AIcrowd antoniu_gugu9) for the ARC White-Box Estimation Challenge 2026, Phase 2
  (AIcrowd WhestBench): per-neuron means of random 1024x16 He-initialised ReLU MLPs within a FLOP budget of 2^41.
  The released estimator is byte-identical to graded submission #337608.
